        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Smithley\n- Companies: Toyota\n- Organizations: JD Motorsports, MBM Motorsports, NASCAR Xfinity Series\n- Products: Chevrolet Camaro, Toyota Camry\n- Topics: stock car racing\n\nFacts:\n- Toyota has sold the Toyota Camry internationally since 1982, and the model has spanned multiple generations.\n- Garrett Smithley was born on April 27, 1992.\n- Garrett Smithley is an American professional stock car racing driver.\n- Garrett Smithley currently competes full-time in the NASCAR Xfinity Series.\n- Garrett Smithley drives the No. 0 Chevrolet Camaro for JD Motorsports in the NASCAR Xfinity Series.\n- Garrett Smithley drives the No. 40 Toyota Camry for MBM Motorsports in the NASCAR Xfinity Series.",
